usage: khojki-ocr [-h] [--checkpoint CHECKPOINT] --output OUTPUT
                  [--device {cpu,cuda,mps}] [--pages PAGES [PAGES ...]]
                  [--pdf-native] [--region LEFT TOP RIGHT BOTTOM]
                  [--threads THREADS]
                  source

Printed Khojki page OCR with UTF-8 output and an offline review page.

positional arguments:
  source                Page image or PDF

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --checkpoint CHECKPOINT
  --output OUTPUT
  --device {cpu,cuda,mps}
  --pages PAGES [PAGES ...]
                        One-based PDF page numbers; default all
  --pdf-native          Use the only embedded image per PDF page, preserving
                        original scan resolution
  --region LEFT TOP RIGHT BOTTOM
                        Optional assisted body crop; default automatic
  --threads THREADS
